== Walkthrough ==
''Note that you can do both the Bone Chips and 2GP quests at dubious, confirmed as of April 2024.''

''Lashun Novashine can be found in North Qeynos wandering from the temple to the front gate, and back. One location at which he stops is -158, -350. ''

You say, 'Hail, Lashun Novashine'

: Lashun Novashine says 'Well met, ______. My name is Lashun Novashine and I am a humble priest of Rodcet Nife, the Prime Healer. I wish to spread His word to every corner of Norrath. My job gets more difficult each day with so many so willing to take lives rather than preserve them.'' 

'''Turn in two [[Bone Chips]], unstacked.'''

: Lashun Novashine says 'Ah good, I see you seek healing. But you must offer the remains of one more minion of Bertoxxulous before Rodcet will deem you worthy.'

: Lashun Novashine says 'Very well, young one. May the light of the Prime Healer wash away your scars.' 

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Priests of Life]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Knights of Thunder]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Antonius Bayle]] got better. 
* Your faction standing with [[Bloodsabers]] got '''worse'''.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}} About 0.5% at level 4.

Lashun Novashine begins to cast a spell. You feel a little better. You have been healed for 14 points.

'''Hand Lashun Novashine 2 Gold.''' (Depending on his inventory of personal gold, copper pieces may work at times)

: Lashun Novashine says 'Thank you for the donation to the Temple of Life. May Rodcet Nife cleanse your body of all ills.' 

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Priests of Life]] got better.
